# Secrets
.env

# Data and build artifacts.
# NOTE: anchored with a leading slash. A bare `data/` also matches
# `coherence/data/`, which silently kept six source modules -- including the
# empirical-posterior oracle the paper's C2 contribution rests on -- out of
# every commit. Do not un-anchor this.
/data/
build/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
codx.egg-info/

# Per-case model output (large; published to the Hub instead)
results/raw/

# --- Credentialed data: MUST NEVER leave this machine ---------------------
# MIMIC-IV-Note is PhysioNet credentialed data under a use agreement that
# forbids redistribution. Only aggregate divergence statistics may be shared.
# `results/raw/` above does NOT match `results/raw_mimic/`, so it is named
# explicitly here rather than relied on by prefix.
results/raw_mimic/
results/*mimic*
**/mimic/
**/physionet/
*discharge.csv
*radiology.csv
